   "id": "soc.climate.temperature-range",
   "name": "Ranges and averages",
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "The daily (diurnal) range is the day's maximum minus its minimum. The daily mean is (max + min) ÷ 2. The annual range is the hottest month minus the coldest month; the annual mean is the sum of the twelve monthly means ÷ 12. In Bega, clear skies give Ethiopia a high diurnal range, but the annual range is low."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "የዕለት የሙቀት ልዩነት ከፍተኛው ሲቀነስ ዝቅተኛው ነው። የዓመት ልዩነት የሞቀው ወር ሲቀነስ የቀዘቀዘው ወር ነው።",
     "machine": true
    }
